sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser (React)
  participant A as FastAPI routes.py
  participant J as Background job jobs.py
  participant P as Pipeline runner.py
  participant G as Google Gemini API
  participant D as SQLite app.db
  B->>A: POST /api/evaluations (rubric_id, files[])
  A->>D: insert EvaluationRow (queued)
  A->>J: asyncio.create_task(_run)
  A-->>B: 200 {id}
  loop every 1 second until done or error
    B->>A: GET /api/evaluations/{id}
    A->>D: read row
    A-->>B: status, stage, detail
  end
  J->>P: evaluate(files, rubric, pages)
  P->>G: page transcriptions (2 readers per page)
  P->>G: judge runs x3 + one embedding batch
  P-->>J: EvaluationResult
  J->>D: save result JSON, status done
  B->>A: GET /api/evaluations/{id}
  A-->>B: result + page image URLs
  B->>A: GET /api/evaluations/{id}/export?fmt=csv
  A-->>B: results-{id}.csv
